msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course explores some of the most promising applications of quantum "
"computing, including Hamiltonian simulation, optimization, machine learning,"
" and partial differential equations. Each application is introduced through "
"its theoretical motivation and then explored through hands-on case studies. "
"We examine how real-world problems are mapped to quantum computers, which "
"quantum techniques they use, and what evidence is needed to assess their "
"potential.\n"
msgstr ""

